# A bsize negative only finalizes at engine eof. For an engine registered at a
# protocol completion state there is no P+1, so the tx end state is that eof:
# ntp.reference_id is registered at progress 1, the NTP completion state, and
# the negated size must be decided there.
alert ntp any any -> any any (msg:"NTP reference ID size not 3"; ntp.reference_id; bsize:!3; sid:1; rev:1;)
